lingmo-oobe (1.6.8.lingmo.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * fix: delete the OOBE autologin account by reading /etc/lingmo-dm.conf
    instead of hard-coding "live"; the installed system keeps the lingmo
    account from the image, so userdel live never matched and lingmo was
    never removed before the user's chosen account was created.

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Wed, 04 Nov 2026 11:35:00 +0800

lingmo-oobe (1.6.7.lingmo.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * fix: finished page description now shows the correct username.
  * fix: reboot button uses systemctl directly (OOBE runs as root).
  * i18n: add missing zh_CN translations for all validation messages,
    hostname field label, placeholder and hint text.

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Tue, 03 Nov 2026 15:10:00 +0800

lingmo-oobe (1.6.6.lingmo.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * feat: add per-field validation for username, password and hostname.
    Username enforced via regex (lowercase, max 32 chars), system account
    names rejected. Password must not be empty. Hostname follows RFC 1123
    (letters, digits, hyphens; not starting/ending with hyphen; max 63).
    Each field has its own inline error label; all errors shown at once.

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Tue, 03 Nov 2026 14:40:00 +0800

lingmo-oobe (1.6.5.lingmo.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * ui: align OOBE controls with Lingmo SDK style via QSS.
    Accent colour, button radii, hover/pressed states and input field
    borders now match the SDK's ButtonBackground, mediumRadius and
    accent::blue values.

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Tue, 03 Nov 2026 14:24:00 +0800

lingmo-oobe (1.6.4.lingmo.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Remove live user after OOBE setup completes for security.
  * Validate username against /etc/passwd before proceeding.
  * Remove live user before useradd so the chosen name is always free,
    even when it matches the live account (e.g. "lingmo").

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Tue, 03 Nov 2026 14:06:00 +0800

